*
******************************************
*
*PMEG6010CEH
*
*NXP Semiconductors
*
*1 A very low Vf MEGA Schottky barrier rectifiers
*
*
*
*
*IFSM = 9A      @ tp = 8ms
*VF   = 570mV   @ IF = 1A
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*Package pinning does not match Spice model pinning.
*Package: SOD123F
*
*Package Pin 1: Cathode
*Package Pin 2: Anode
*
*
*
*
*Simulator: SPICE3
*
******************************************
*
.SUBCKT PMEG6010CEH 1 2
*
D1 1 2 PMEG6010CEH
R1 1 2 1E+7
*
* The Resistor R1 does not reflect
* a physical device. Instead it
* improves modeling in the reverse
* mode of operation.
*
.MODEL PMEG6010CEH D
+ IS = 3.962E-7
+ N = 0.9774
+ BV = 66
+ IBV = 1.1E-5
+ RS = 0.2033
+ CJO = 1.103E-10
+ VJ = 0.3756
+ M = 0.4916
+ EG = 0.69
+ XTI = 2
.ENDS
*
